        DESCRIPTION "Target level 21, as Major Virtue (speak to elementally-pure objects)\n\nScript Bonus +15: Ordeal (Major Flaw Pious replaces Minor Flaw Higher Purpose) +6, Ordeal (equivalent of Supernatural Nuisance) +3, Ordeal (Disfigured) +3, Mystagogue’s time +3"
    }

